  "causebase_summary": "The Corporation Of The Trustees Of The Order Of The Sisters Of Mercy In Queensland appears in the ACNC register and publishes a website (brisbanemercy.org.au) with news items about congregation life and milestone events. Website excerpts record a 70‑year anniversary for Sister Catharine Courtney (Sister Mary Benedict) on 8 November 2022, a gathering in Aubigny at ‘Mater’ on 27 November 2019, a farewell to Robyn Rodwell published 15 November 2019, and a page titled “Celebrating 130 Years of Service Excellence.” One excerpt states “The Sisters of Mercy, Brisbane Congregation, recently joined with Board and staff members from Holy …” (excerpt truncated). The ACNC AIS extract for 2023 included in the evidence pack shows reported revenue of 0 AUD and total expenses of 0 AUD for the subject entity. Recorded material therefore documents a sequence of commemorative and organisational events involving Sisters of Mercy and associated board and staff, and the organisation’s public website activity; it does not provide program descriptions, service delivery details, staffing numbers, or confirmed beneficiaries beyond congregation members mentioned in the excerpts.",
